Have you been indignant about not grabbing time limited goods? Have you been moping about not getting your favorite course? Have you been worried about not getting the ticket home? 

Float-Clock is a simple and intelligent desktop time app, which can be displayed on top of all applications! Come and download the experience!  
[Use Scenario]   # Online Shopping Mall - killing low price goods in a limited time;   # Rush to buy tickets - real-time and fast;   # Time display - display the current time in full screen; 

[Feature]   # You can hover display time on any app;   # It can control the millisecond opening switch, which is extremely accurate;   # Notification function, no longer miss your favorite products;   # Countdown function to meet multiple demands;  
[Contact Us]
Your suggestions are very important to me. You can use the "Feedback" in the app to contact me.
